+| `filterBody => (...)` | 29–35 | `8e8f01b5e0fd33ceb875a3d4d5eaaabb18bf343c33360eb7a965dd98e22a8685` | `DEFINITION` | Expands the fresh `filterBody` macro to the exact source function-body AST. |
